    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B03",
      "act": "point-2",
      "narration_text": "The same day, Claude Code and I built the first sample, the ball and the feather from section three point five: a beat sheet, a pedagogy file, a Manim script, and Kokoro narration. I also started researching pedagogy styles.",
